    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d268-a16">

                <pb facs="0714" n="628" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v1/pg628"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 16.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic"><persName corresp="#p_CEDL1" type="from">C. E. De
                            Long</persName> to <persName type="to">Soyeshima Tane-omi, Oyeno
                            Kagenori, and Mr. Garcia</persName>.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United
                                States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Yokohama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1873-08-12"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 12, 1873</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 64.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p>The undersigned has the honor to advise you that on yesterday he signed the bill
                    of sale of the bark Maria Luz, and received from C. A. Fletcher &amp; Co. the
                    proceeds of her sale, less their account of sales, for which please find copy of
                    their receipt, (marked inclosure No. 1,) paid Messrs. Walsh, Hall &amp; Co. the
                    account for expenses of vessel to date, for which please find copy of their
                    receipt (marked inclosure No. 2,) and deposited the balance in the Hong-Kong and
                    Shanghai Bank in trust for the creditors of the bark Maria Luz, as per
                    certificate to that effect, marked inclosure No. 3.</p>
                <p>Trusting that in this action he has followed your wishes, the undersigned has the
                    honor to subscribe himself your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><persName corresp="#p_CEDL1">C. E. DE LONG</persName>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
